; The airframe under Drone is NOT authored here. It is generated at runtime by
; AirframeModel from the same Build the physics reads, so the frame, motors and props on
; screen are the parts that were chosen in Lab (labs-and-sim.md §3). What used to sit here
; was a BoxMesh plus four cylinders with the 5" arm's motor positions baked in as 0.0778 and
; no propellers at all, which meant choosing the 7" frame flew a 150 mm arm and drew a 5"
; prop-less box.
